Error [jet.MissingPageFunction]: Convention file `routes_commented/About.jet` has no `fn page`
  --> tests/ui/web_app_routes_commented.jet:4:22
    |
  4 | fn run() { web.app().routes(from: "routes_commented").csr().serve() }
    |                      ^^^^^^
 Why: Files under a `.routes(from:)` root must declare `fn page` or start with `_` to opt out. A file without a page would register an endpoint the compiler cannot analyze.
 Fix: Add `fn page()`, rename the file with a leading `_`, or remove it from the routes directory.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E2806
